{
  "slug": "merit-aktiva-for-ai-agents",
  "name": "Merit Aktiva For Ai Agents",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude and other AI agents to Merit Aktiva — Estonia's most-used accounting software — and let them handle real bookkeeping safely. Six Claude Code skills that teach Claude the official Merit Aktiva REST API (HMAC-SHA256\n  signing, sales invoices, purchase invoices, payments, GL, bank statement import) and the 2026 Estonian tax rules (VAT 24/13/9, distributed-profit CIT 22/78, payroll, KMD codes, fringe benefits, board-member fees). Bilingual README in\n  English and Estonian. Every write call requires explicit user confirmation by default. All rates verified against emta.ee; all API specs verified against api.merit.ee. Not an official Merit Tarkvara product.\n\n  (~700 chars — should fit most \"concise\" description limits. If the form caps shorter, here's a 280-char cut:)\n\n  Six Claude Code skills that let AI agents operate Merit Aktiva, Estonia's #1 accounting software. Covers the full REST API (HMAC-SHA256 auth, invoices, payments, GL, e-arve, bank import) plus 2026 Estonian tax rules (VAT, CIT, payroll,\n  KMD). Confirmation guardrail on every write. Bilingual.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `estonian-bookkeeping` (Apply current (2026) Estonian tax rules — VAT (käibemaks) 24/13/9, distributed-profit CIT 22/78, payroll taxes, KMD codes, fringe…), `merit-aktiva-core` (Authenticate and call the Merit Aktiva REST API — HMAC-SHA256 query-string signing, request conventions, rate limits, error handling), `merit-aktiva-ledger-reports` (Create general-ledger journal entries (sendglbatch) and pull P&L (getprofitrep), balance sheet (getbalancerep), customer-debt (getcustdebtrep), sales (getsalesrep), and inventory…), `merit-aktiva-masters` (Look up and create Merit Aktiva customers, vendors, items, tax codes, and chart-of-accounts entries), `merit-aktiva-purchases-payments` (Post purchase invoices and expense claims, record payments, and import bank statements (camt.053) in Merit Aktiva), `merit-aktiva-sales` (Create, list, credit, and email sales invoices in Merit Aktiva; trigger e-invoices via Omniva/Telema/bank)\n- **Agents** (1): `merit-bookkeeper` (End-to-end Estonian bookkeeping subagent for Merit Aktiva)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install merit-aktiva-for-ai-agents@claude-community` from `arturl95/merit-aktiva-skills`.",
